1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Field Work — the guide for field executives.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,200
Everything you do in a day, one button at a time.

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:10,800
My Day is the whole application. Open it in the morning and stay there.

4
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:14,800
The numbers at the top fill in by themselves as you work.

5
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,800
You never type your own figures.

6
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:22,000
First, press Start my day to mark your attendance.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,400
The card turns green. Now your visits and travel are unlocked.

8
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:30,000
Before you leave, record your odometer.

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,600
Type the reading and photograph it. The photo is not optional.

10
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:38,600
Your travel claim is worked out from these two numbers.

11
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:42,200
Every clinic on your round today is a card.

12
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:46,200
Navigate opens your map. Call rings the clinic.

13
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:50,800
On a phone the button shows only a picture: a pin means I'm Here.

14
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:54,800
Press I'm Here when you are standing at the clinic.

15
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:59,200
Not in the car on the way — the app records where you are.

16
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:03,600
If it says Location is off, turn location on and tap again.

17
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:08,000
For each patient the doctor gives you, open a case slip.

18
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:12,200
From the visit, tap the three dots, then Add Case.

19
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:16,200
Fill it in while the doctor is still in front of you.

20
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:20,400
Add a line opens the list of everything the lab makes.

21
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:25,000
Tap the appliance, then set upper or lower, quantity and colour.

22
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:28,800
When the slip is complete, press Submit Case.

23
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:32,400
Five cases from one doctor means five slips.

24
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:36,600
Made a mistake? Press Reopen, fix it, submit again.

25
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:40,800
Before you leave, say what happened at this clinic.

26
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:45,000
Count the cases, and tap every outcome that applies.

27
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,600
If you collected money, enter the amount.

28
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:52,800
You must say whether it was cash, cheque or online.

29
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:56,200
Then press Save, and Finish Visit.

30
00:01:56,200 --> 00:02:00,800
The visit is closed and your case slips have gone to the office.

31
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:05,200
You can still correct the cases, the outcome and the payment.

32
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:08,800
Back on My Day, your numbers have moved.

33
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:13,000
Go to the next clinic and do the same three steps again.

34
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:17,000
Collected cash? Tell the system you are carrying it.

35
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:21,400
On the finished visit, three dots, then Cash into My Float.

36
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:26,000
It records where the money is. You still hand it to the office.

37
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:29,800
Money does not always arrive with the paperwork.

38
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:34,400
A doctor settles an old bill while you are there for something else.

39
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:39,200
Tap Cash in. No visit needed — never invent one to carry money.

40
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:44,000
It counts in today's total, your day sheet and your target straight away.

41
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:47,800
The question every doctor asks at the counter.

42
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:51,800
Track order answers it without phoning the lab.

43
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:55,800
Doctors and Clinics shows everyone on your route.

44
00:02:55,800 --> 00:03:00,000
Making an extra stop? New visit adds it to today.

45
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:04,000
At the end of the day, open Travel one last time.

46
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:08,400
Closing reading, closing photo, Save, then End the Day.

47
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:12,600
Your kilometres and your claim are calculated for you.

48
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:15,800
You never work this out yourself.

49
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:19,600
Last of all, press End the day on My Day.

50
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:24,200
Your day sheet is built for you overnight — there is nothing to type.

51
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:28,400
Start your day first. Press I'm Here at the door.

52
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:33,000
One slip per patient, and say what happened before you finish.

53
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:37,600
Photograph the odometer twice, and enter cases the same day.

54
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:42,200
And put the cash you collected into your float before you go home.

